1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,000
Ceng Niu,

25
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:17,000
if you kill me,

26
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:19,240
the country of Suzaku won't let that slide !

27
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,320
A genius like you

28
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:23,920
shouldn't be threatening me like that.

29
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,760
Red Butterfly,

30
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,680
didn’t you want to fight me again ?

31
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:37,130
I can't use the Return Cauldron in the overlapping fragments.

32
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,000
If I escape this,

33
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:39,800
I will only be on the second layer.

34
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,160
An Early stage Soul Formation

35
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:00,880
cannot stop me !

36
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:02,920
Time !

37
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,200
This is...

38
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,160
a time domain ?

39
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:22,200
Under normal circumstances,

40
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,840
this unfinished domain

41
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,200
wouldn't stand a single blow.

42
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:28,160
But now that I'm injured,

43
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,400
he pushed me this far...

44
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:34,720
Die !

45
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,680
This can't go on !

46
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:53,680
A teleportation artifact of Suzaku ?

47
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:56,880
No wonder she was so confident in the Celestial Realm.

48
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,840
I will remember you, Ceng Niu !

49
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,440
Today,

50
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,320
you forced me to give up one level of cultivation

51
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:05,200
to be able to use this bracelet.

52
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:06,960
But tomorrow,

53
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,440
I will pay you back a hundred times !

54
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,160
I'll see you on planet Suzaku !

55
00:04:12,210 --> 00:04:14,240
Her Emotionless Domain is too strong.

56
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,480
Red Butterfly,

57
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,320
what do you think this is ?

58
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,920
Xue Yue's
Seven Feathered Fan

59
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,160
Senior Sister's fan...

60
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,840
Red Butterfly's domain is weakened !

61
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,600
You can't escape !

62
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:53,280
It was so close...

63
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,600
Even if I didn't kill her,

64
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,600
with this arm

65
00:04:58,080 --> 00:05:00,280
I can use countless curses

66
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,360
to ensure that

67
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:05,880
she will forever remain at Soul Formation.

68
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:14,000
What ? It's blocked ?

69
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:22,120
As expected,

70
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:25,760
I can't use the Return Cauldron from here.

71
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,320
There's no way to go back anymore.

72
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,280
Brother Chi Hu

73
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,080
Brother Ceng !

74
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,440
It's impossible to return to the second layer.

75
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,000
If we want a chance to survive,

76
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,680
we must go to the next layer.

77
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:49,080
Brother Chi Hu,

78
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,800
you and I have the lowest cultivation level.

79
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,200
We must work together.

80
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:55,240
Brother Ceng wants to go to the fourth layer ?

81
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,600
But do you know where the entrance is ?

82
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:16,120
Brother Ceng had already prepared for this...

83
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:17,560
According to Zhou Yi,

84
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:21,000
if a single of the 6 overlapping fragments collapses,

85
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:23,380
even if we go to the fourth layer,

86
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:26,160
it's only a matter of time before it collapses too.

87
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:29,480
The only way to leave this place

88
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,760
is with Chi Hu’s star compass.

89
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:38,400
Fourth layer of the
overlapping fragments
Rain Celestial Realm

90
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,400
Is this whole palace

91
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,440
really made of celestial jades ?!

92
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:04,680
The owner of this place must have been important.

93
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:08,600
Zhou Yi,

94
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:09,840
you madman !

95
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,560
I even returned the corpse to you !

96
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,240
Why don't you just leave me alone ?

97
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:17,640
Zhou Yi,

98
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:20,240
if you burn your Origin Soul like that you will die.

99
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:22,200
Don't try to drag me down with you !

100
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:43,520
You

101
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,400
should be punished

102
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:47,360
for offending Ting'er.

103
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:50,560
My head...

104
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,360
hurts so bad...

105
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:04,880
Ting'er,

106
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,680
after I kill him,

107
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:09,800
we will go into the void, okay ?

108
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,040
If you fight like that,

109
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,840
you will run out sooner or later.

110
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:41,680
I just need to hold on for a moment

111
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:43,520
and you're going to fall apart !

112
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,440
You can't kill me !

113
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:48,960
Ting'er,

114
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:52,720
something seems to be awakening in my memory...

115
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:04,520
He's running out of energy...

116
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,680
I'm afraid he won't last long.

117
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:23,960
I won !

118
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,360
Zhou Yi,

119
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:28,600
you were once the pride of the Five Elements Sect.

120
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,920
But just for a female corpse,

121
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:34,280
you burned your own Origin Soul.

122
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:39,800
I have been looking for it all my life.

123
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:42,280
I never thought that in the end,

124
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:44,760
thanks to my own Origin Soul burning,

125
00:09:45,050 --> 00:09:47,080
I would finally understand…

126
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:57,640
Something

127
00:09:58,640 --> 00:09:59,560
is coming !

128
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,200
What the hell is this ?

129
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,120
Such a powerful force !

130
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,160
So this is

131
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,720
the Dao.

132
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:35,650
Master once told me that those who seek the Dao

133
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:38,640
are willing to die at sunset to find the right path in the morning.

134
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:40,960
So this is what he meant…

135
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:02,520
Zhou Yi
Ascendant Origin Soul

136
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,160
Asc...

137
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:10,760
Ascendant...

138
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:12,760
Ting'er,

139
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:14,680
I remember now...

140
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:17,160
I remember everything...

141
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:24,480
Young Zhou Yi

142
00:11:20,090 --> 00:11:22,450
Main Hall of the
Five Elements Sect

143
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,640
I was born gifted with talent

144
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:24,440
so I became a disciple of the Five Elements Sect thousands of years ago.

145
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,440
Everyone in the sect had high hopes for me.

146
00:11:27,640 --> 00:11:30,400
They thought I'd become a powerful figure of the cultivation world.

147
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:33,960
On the day I reached Soul Formation,

148
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:36,480
my master gave me a Rain Cauldron

149
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:39,680
so that I could try my luck in the Celestial Realm.

150
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,440
In the Celestial Realm,

151
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:45,240
I met you.

152
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:49,440
I thought my obsession came from my love towards you

153
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:52,480
but the truth is that

154
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:55,880
you forced the craze domain onto me.

155
00:11:56,520 --> 00:12:00,080
Just so that I would collect celestial jades to protect your body.

156
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,640
For that purpose,

157
00:12:02,160 --> 00:12:04,080
I stole the sect's celestial jades.

158
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:08,640
My master was furious so he kicked me out of the sect.

159
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:12,720
He then failed to reach Ascendant and died before I could see him again.

160
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:16,080
I was never able

161
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:17,800
to repay his kindness...

162
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:23,160
I secretly saved the Five Elements Sect 3 times,

163
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,280
to seek inner peace.

164
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:29,600
There was no place left for me in this world

165
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:31,840
but I still took you everywhere with me.

166
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:35,640
No matter if they were evil or righteous,

167
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,560
they all rejected me.

168
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:44,200
I went from an ambitious prodigy

169
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:47,240
to living as a joke in the eyes of everyone.

170
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:50,120
My domain is craze.

171
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:52,720
You are my Dao Heart.

172
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:55,960
No one in this world is perfect.

173
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:59,200
I, Zhou Yi, have let down too many people in my life.

174
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:02,040
But the only thing I don't want to do

175
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:04,640
is to let you down.

176
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:08,180
Even if I have to die,

177
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,920
I will happily do it.

178
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:13,280
If I were given another chance,

179
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:16,600
I would choose

180
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,240
to meet you again.

181
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:28,400
Little Brother,

182
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,560
after I die,

183
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:33,280
help me take care of my wife.

184
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:34,160
Okay ?

185
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:36,720
This...

186
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:39,240
Zhou Yi is famous on planet Suzaku

187
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:40,990
for this female corpse.

188
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:43,080
I'm afraid it's not going to be easy.

189
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:45,880
If word gets out that I have the corpse,

190
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:49,080
I will be disowned from the clan.

191
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:51,160
But if I anger him...

192
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,440
I'm afraid he...

193
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,400
Junior is willing to do it.

194
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:00,960
You are the young master of the Giant Demon Clan

195
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,960
so it is natural that you would be afraid

196
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,960
to follow my footsteps.

197
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:06,640
Forget it.

198
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:15,840
Are you willing to help me ?

199
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,560
My wife

200
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:21,600
needs 1000 celestial jades every 1000 years to sustain her body.

201
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:24,800
It's a bit difficult, but manageable.

202
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:25,760
Little Brother,

203
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:27,680
are you willing to help ?

204
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:32,160
I don’t dare to promise that I can obtain that many celestial jades.

205
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,880
I won’t let you help me

206
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:37,400
for thousands of years for free.

207
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,440
This pagoda

208
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:36,960
contains my Ascendant domain.

209
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:38,920
Place it down

210
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:41,160
and unless someone is above my current cultivation,

211
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:42,680
they won't be able to pass.

212
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:46,760
Ascendant Crystal

213
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,880
This is the first gift I give you,

214
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:47,600
an Ascendant Crystal.

215
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:49,880
It's useless to you right now,

216
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:52,880
but if one day you are about to reach the Ascendant stage,

217
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:54,120
then it will help you.

218
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:55,640
An Ascendant Crystal !

219
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:58,760
It's formed during an Ascendant breakthrough.

220
00:15:58,880 --> 00:16:00,480
It's no different from your life.

221
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,280
Gifting it unheard of...

222
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:04,800
If I could have it,

223
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:08,960
I would have a hope to reach Ascendant in my life.

224
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:11,040
But...

225
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:13,920
If the first gift is so precious,

226
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:15,960
then what about the second one ?

227
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:16,920
And the third one ?

228
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:21,040
My second gift to you is this person.

229
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:23,880
Head Elder of the Corpse Sect,

230
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:25,200
I can spare your life,

231
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:28,080
but you must become a slave for 1000 years.

232
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:30,000
Are you

233
00:16:30,040 --> 00:16:31,120
willing ?

234
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:32,760
This...

235
00:16:33,280 --> 00:16:35,320
My life won’t even last another 100 years,

236
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:37,080
so how can I be a slave for 1000 years ?

237
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:40,040
Your lifespan is your own problem.

238
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:42,320
If you just want to die,

239
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,160
then I can help you.

240
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:47,600
With my remaining strength, I can refine you into a weaker puppet.

241
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:48,680
Easily.

242
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:52,600
I agree.

243
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:59,120
This slave restriction is extremely clever.

244
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:01,360
With just a single thought,

245
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,560
I can crush the soul

246
00:17:04,280 --> 00:17:06,280
of this Soul Transformation cultivator.

247
00:17:09,120 --> 00:17:10,760
This old slave Sun Tai

248
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:12,040
greets Master…

249
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:14,800
A Soul Transformation cultivator as a slave ?

250
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,600
With this person in my hands,

251
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:20,160
aside from the country of Suzaku,

252
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:22,280
I would be able to freely traverse the planet.

253
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:26,040
Take good care of her.

254
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:30,040
Master,

255
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:32,040
I was unfilial,

256
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,400
I'm sorry for what I've done to you.

257
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,520
If there is an afterlife,

258
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:39,120
I’m still your disciple…

259
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:45,320
You

260
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:47,880
won't die today.

261
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,880
First Rain Celestial Sword,

262
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:08,840
appear !

263
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:24,560
She...

264
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:26,920
Who the hell is she ?!

265
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:29,920
First Rain Celestial Sword

266
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:33,640
Is this...

267
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:35,400
a celestial sword ?

268
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:47,000
You protected me for more than 2000 years,

269
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:48,080
you...

270
00:18:48,600 --> 00:18:49,520
worked hard.

271
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:54,040
I will make you the Sword Spirit of this celestial sword.

272
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,960
In 10 000 years,

273
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:59,960
you will become a Celestial Saint.

274
00:19:01,830 --> 00:21:37,340
Many people claim Zhou Yi had a breakthrough to Ascendant and they are probably right because the novel explicitly said that the Ascendant Crystal he gave to Wang Lin had been just formed.

However, I think that this wasn't an Ascendant breakthrough (or that the Er Gen hadn't figured out yet how to portray an Ascendant breakthrough). Maybe you'll understand what I mean when we see one. Also, the jump from Middle stage Soul Transformation to Ascendant is a bit too much even when considering he burned his Origin Soul. My theory is that he reached Ascendant some time after he became crazy, he hid his Ascendant Crystal and then forgot. His true cultivation was locked behind his memories. Recovering his memory was the key to unlocking his cultivation.
This doesn't really change anything but I wanted to share my thoughts.

"Celestial Saint" here is the only instance of these words in the entire novel and there is no information on what they mean. It doesn't correspond to any celestial cultivation level. I think it may be either an honorific title or Er Gen wrote it as a celestial cultivation level and changed their names later on.

275
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:25,120
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

276
00:19:25,190 --> 00:19:31,280
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

277
00:19:31,390 --> 00:19:35,220
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

278
00:19:35,250 --> 00:19:39,150
and like many other unseparable things.

279
00:19:39,510 --> 00:19:45,160
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

280
00:19:46,340 --> 00:19:52,170
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

281
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:58,020
Use the most vivid love and hate
to ask questions to your fate.

282
00:19:58,480 --> 00:20:02,700
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

283
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:06,190
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

284
00:20:06,360 --> 00:20:12,180
Only when you bend down can you understand
the hidden edge of the blade.

285
00:20:12,700 --> 00:20:16,380
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

286
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:20,300
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

287
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:26,150
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

288
00:20:26,410 --> 00:20:30,080
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

289
00:20:30,290 --> 00:20:33,860
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

290
00:20:33,980 --> 00:20:39,900
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

